<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>Verify Your Email Address</title>
  <style>
    body {
      margin: 0;
      padding: 0;
      background-color: #07090e;
      color: #e2e8f0;
      font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", Roboto, "Helvetica Neue", Arial, sans-serif;
      -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;
    }
    .wrapper {
      width: 100%;
      background-color: #07090e;
      padding: 40px 0;
    }
    .container {
      max-width: 580px;
      margin: 0 auto;
      background-color: #0d1117;
      border: 1px solid rgba(0, 255, 157, 0.2);
      border-radius: 8px;
      overflow: hidden;
      box-shadow: 0 8px 30px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.6);
    }
    .header {
      padding: 24px 32px;
      border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);
      background: linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(16, 24, 39, 0.8) 0%, rgba(13, 17, 23, 0.8) 100%);
    }
    .logo-badge {
      display: inline-block;
      padding: 4px 10px;
      background-color: rgba(0, 255, 157, 0.1);
      border: 1px solid rgba(0, 255, 157, 0.3);
      border-radius: 4px;
      color: #00ff9d;
      font-size: 12px;
      font-weight: 700;
      letter-spacing: 1.5px;
      font-family: monospace;
    }
    .content {
      padding: 36px 32px;
    }
    h1 {
      margin: 0 0 16px 0;
      font-size: 20px;
      color: #ffffff;
      font-weight: 600;
      letter-spacing: -0.5px;
    }
    p {
      margin: 0 0 16px 0;
      font-size: 14px;
      line-height: 1.6;
      color: #94a3b8;
    }
    .btn-container {
      margin: 28px 0;
      text-align: center;
    }
    .btn {
      display: inline-block;
      padding: 12px 32px;
      background-color: #00ff9d;
      color: #07090e !important;
      text-decoration: none;
      font-size: 14px;
      font-weight: 700;
      border-radius: 4px;
      letter-spacing: 0.5px;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      font-family: monospace;
    }
    .raw-link-box {
      margin-top: 24px;
      padding: 16px;
      background-color: #07090e;
      border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);
      border-radius: 4px;
      word-break: break-all;
      font-family: monospace;
      font-size: 12px;
      color: #64748b;
    }
    .raw-link-box a {
      color: #00ff9d;
      text-decoration: none;
    }
    .footer {
      padding: 24px 32px;
      border-top: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);
      font-size: 12px;
      color: #64748b;
      font-family: monospace;
      text-align: center;
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="wrapper">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="header">
        <div class="logo-badge">ZYRON // PROTOCOL_SECURITY</div>
      </div>
      <div class="content">
        <h1>Verify Your Account Email</h1>
        <p>Hello <strong>{{name}}</strong>,</p>
        <p>Thank you for registering on Zyron. To activate your account and access your protocol audit workspace, please verify your email address using the button below:</p>
        
        <div class="btn-container">
          <a href="{{verificationUrl}}" class="btn" target="_blank">Verify Email Address</a>
        </div>

        <p>This verification link expires in <strong>24 hours</strong> and can only be used once.</p>

        <div class="raw-link-box">
          Button not working? Copy and paste this URL into your browser:<br>
          <a href="{{verificationUrl}}">{{verificationUrl}}</a>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="footer">
        © {{currentYear}} Zyron Protocol Security. All rights reserved.<br>
        If you did not create an account on Zyron, you can safely ignore this email.
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</body>
</html>
